   cost i≤BTG i*(factor i).natDegree
 BHX:resultant.natDegree≤budget
theorem LB.CTA
   {I:Type*} [Fintype I]
   {multiplicity cost:I→ℕ} {budget:ℕ}
   (C:LB
     (Base:=Base) multiplicity cost budget):
   (∑ i,multiplicity i*cost i)≤budget:=by
