 (hr:14≤p.all) (hR:p.all≤50) (hy:59≤middle p) (hY:middle p≤229)
 (ht:total p≤11784) (hs: ¬TG.cheap.Routeable p):
 total p≤BU.cut p.all (middle p):=by
