theorem AGJ (rv yv i j k:ℕ)
 (hr:14≤rv) (hR:rv≤50) (hy:59≤yv) (hY:yv≤229)
 (ht:3611≤BU.cut rv yv) (hi:i<8) (hj:j<2) (hk:k<16) (hg:Good rv k):
 let (r,y,t):=BU.core rv yv (BU.cut rv yv) i
